# Otogi: Myth of Demons (46530002): docs/testing/titles/routes/otogi.route
# with a timing-tolerant title. lane.slowtier2, 2026-09-28, for #462 phase
# 2b's re-pilot (NOTES.md, "Attempt 3").
#
# Why: the master route presses START once, at +48 s. Its one good run
# (titleroutes-1129571, 9e7f8418dc) logged its first hakuX-perf frame at
# +12 s and the title's transition at +22.5 s, so START came ~28 s into the
# title. The perflog pilot (0-0-s-1-1790609660-lane.slowtier2-otogi762702,
# 97a6fa2b51) logged its first frame at +4 s and the transition at +14 s, so
# START came ~37 s into the title. Its intro and gameplay frames both show
# "PRESS START BUTTON". Most likely (inferred, no frame between) the title
# had given way to its attract loop by then, and START only returned to the
# title. A never leaves the title.
#
# The fix: four STARTs, 6 s apart, from +22 s. For a title at +14..+22 s at
# least one lands on the title, and none lands later than ~26 s into it. A
# START that lands in the main menu or the save prompts is taken as a
# forward step (inferred: the A presses that follow cover either case).
# From the menu on, this is the master route: A every 5 s through the menus,
# A every 4 s through the intro (four more than master, as margin for the
# earlier start), and one B. Two extra shots (title, menu) show where the
# START presses landed.
#
wait 20.0
shot title
wait 2.0
press START
wait 6.0
press START
wait 6.0
press START
wait 6.0
press START
wait 10.0
shot menu
wait 15.0
press A
wait 5.0
press A
wait 5.0
press A
wait 5.0
press A
wait 5.0
press A
wait 5.0
press A
wait 5.0
shot intro
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press A
wait 4.0
press B
wait 3.0
mark gameplay
repeat forever {
    axis LY min
    wait 1.5
    press X 150
    wait 0.3
    press X 150
    wait 0.3
    axis LY mid
    axis LX max
    wait 1
    axis LX mid
    press A 150
    wait 0.5
    press X 150
    wait 0.3
    axis LY max
    wait 1.5
    axis LY mid
    axis LX min
    wait 1
    axis LX mid
    press X 150
    wait 0.5
}
